      "id": "guide-choose-photographer",
      "index": 1,
      "title": "How to choose your wedding photographer — 7 questions",
      "pillar": "Educational",
      "platform": "Instagram Feed",
      "status": "Published",
      "post_at": "2026-11-12T10:00:00Z",
      "published_at": "2026-11-12",
      "blog": "/blog/how-to-choose-a-wedding-photographer-vancouver.html",
      "caption": "Your photographer is the one vendor you can't re-do. The cake gets eaten, the flowers wilt — the photos are what's left. So vet them like it matters.\n\nSeven questions that go past the portfolio: can I see a full gallery, not the highlight reel? What's your backup if you get sick? How are the files protected? When do I get them? Is there a second shooter — and who? What does the contract actually cover? Do I get everything?\n\nThe honest one hides under all of them: do I feel like myself around you? That's what shows up in the photos. Full guide on the journal — link in bio. 🤍",
