      "caption": "A Japanese garden, a short guest list, and a cake you could carry in one hand.\n\nSara and Vincent got married under the maples, about as far from a ballroom as you can get and still be in Vancouver. Moss, a stone bridge, and everyone close enough to hear the vows without a microphone.\n\nThen ten minutes down the hill for portraits against glass and water. Same city, completely different room.\n\nSmall is not the same as less.",
